  m_text: "The jar I finished today is awesome! Love the details on it. This morning
    Ms. Maya and I had a small chat before she had to leave. So happy that I got
    mention Mama a bit!\n\nAnyways I need to call Mama right after I get back home.
    My aunt haven\u2019t gotten back to me since she went with Mama for her check
    up at the hospital..."
